      ":question/worked-solution": "To raise the product of two numbers to the power of $4$, we can raise each number to the power of $4,$ and then multiply:\n\n$$\n\\left(\\frac{1}{7}\\times \\frac{6}{7}\\right)^{4}=\\left(\\frac{1}{7}\\right)^{4}\\times \\left(\\frac{6}{7}\\right)^{4}\n$$"
